# Open national name-frequency lists behind the Tier 2 person-name training data (tools/data/provenance/names-tier2.md has the terms of
# each, quoted from its publisher). Format: file <local name> <size in bytes> <sha256> <url> [<JSON request body for a POST>].
# The statistics offices' query APIs answer for the latest period when asked, so the pin is the hash: a newer release fails the check
# until the pin and the provenance entry are updated on purpose. Hashes and sizes are filled in by `RECORD=1 fetch.sh pins/names-tier2.pin`.
